WEBVTT

00:01.001 --> 00:03.920
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:31.508 --> 01:33.009
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

01:33.092 --> 01:34.469
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

01:35.804 --> 01:38.515
<i>A few high-ranking officials</i>
<i>who grasped the situation</i>

01:38.598 --> 01:40.892
<i>have already gone out to search, but…</i>

01:41.726 --> 01:43.686
Where in the world could he have gone?

01:43.770 --> 01:46.689
Maybe he disappeared
with his female attendant.

01:46.773 --> 01:48.233
A secret date?

01:49.651 --> 01:52.112
<i>No way. That’s ridiculous.</i>

01:52.987 --> 01:54.114
<i>However…</i>

01:54.197 --> 01:56.491
<i>It’s been two hours</i>
<i>since he left his seat.</i>

01:57.200 --> 02:00.745
<i>I’ve sent subordinates to search for him,</i>
<i>but there’s been no progress.</i>

02:01.913 --> 02:04.833
<i>Right now, I can’t</i>
<i>rely on my father either.</i>

02:05.708 --> 02:07.377
<i>Earlier, he seemed to have given</i>

02:07.460 --> 02:08.586
<i>some sort of order to that maid.</i>

02:10.171 --> 02:13.341
<i>But still, no matter what the master said,</i>
<i>I should have gone with him.</i>

02:14.259 --> 02:16.845
<i>I’m sick of playing a meaningless role.</i>

02:17.720 --> 02:19.097
<i>If only the host</i>

02:19.180 --> 02:21.266
<i>would bring this gathering to an end.</i>

02:23.143 --> 02:24.060
<i>Shishou.</i>

02:24.644 --> 02:26.146
<i>As always,</i>

02:26.229 --> 02:28.982
<i>he’s a man whose thoughts</i>
<i>are impossible to read.</i>

02:29.607 --> 02:32.569
<i>That said, he wouldn't want any trouble</i>

02:32.652 --> 02:35.071
<i>at a banquet he's hosting.</i>

02:35.155 --> 02:36.239
<i>Which means…</i>

02:36.322 --> 02:38.533
<i>This matter likely has</i>
<i>nothing to do with Shishou.</i>

02:53.089 --> 02:54.465
<i>It’s warm.</i>

02:54.549 --> 02:57.385
<i>And there's a faint scent</i>
<i>of incense as well.</i>

02:57.468 --> 03:00.805
<i>But more importantly, this is…?</i>

03:03.725 --> 03:04.809
<i>What is this?</i>

03:06.019 --> 03:07.437
<i>Is it that frog from earlier?</i>

03:07.520 --> 03:09.397
<i>It’s too big for that, though.</i>

03:10.231 --> 03:11.858
Sorry, but…

03:11.941 --> 03:14.319
could you move your hand away from there?

03:14.402 --> 03:15.987
There’s a situation down there.

03:17.363 --> 03:18.197
A situation?

03:24.329 --> 03:25.997
<i>It can’t be.</i>

03:26.080 --> 03:28.499
<i>A eunuch who enters the rear palace…</i>

03:28.583 --> 03:30.126
<i>should not have this.</i>

03:31.669 --> 03:33.129
<i>But he does.</i>

03:37.342 --> 03:38.968
<i>Thinking back,</i>
<i>he never acted like a eunuch.</i>

03:39.594 --> 03:42.013
<i>There are plenty of things</i>
<i>that come to mind,</i>

03:42.096 --> 03:46.476
<i>but maybe I unconsciously</i>
<i>avoided thinking about them.</i>

03:47.018 --> 03:49.229
<i>He has the face of a celestial maiden,</i>

03:49.312 --> 03:50.897
<i>but Lord Jinshi is…</i>

03:52.398 --> 03:56.236
In a way, this saves me
the trouble of having to explain.

04:01.574 --> 04:03.201
I want to tell you something.

04:03.284 --> 04:06.037
<i>No, I must not hear any more.</i>

04:06.704 --> 04:09.290
That is why I brought you along this time.

04:09.374 --> 04:12.460
<i>Once I hear this,</i>
<i>I’ll have to take it to the grave.</i>

04:12.543 --> 04:14.128
Apothecary, I--

04:14.212 --> 04:16.172
My apologies!

04:16.256 --> 04:19.092
I might have crushed a frog.

04:19.175 --> 04:21.427
Huh? A frog?

04:22.845 --> 04:25.014
It suddenly fell from above,

04:25.098 --> 04:27.225
and I lost my balance.

04:27.308 --> 04:28.977
Are you injured?

04:29.686 --> 04:31.813
-No, that was not a frog--
-It was a frog!

04:32.438 --> 04:34.983
<i>A frog. That was a frog.</i>

04:35.566 --> 04:37.777
Come on,
let’s hurry up and get out of here.

04:41.072 --> 04:42.865
A frog, you say?

04:46.035 --> 04:48.788
If it wasn’t a frog, then what was it?

04:48.871 --> 04:50.999
Frogs are usually smaller, aren’t they?

04:51.082 --> 04:55.003
In this season,
there are plenty of fairly large frogs.

04:55.086 --> 04:56.462
Fairly…?

04:56.546 --> 04:58.172
Yes, fairly!

04:58.256 --> 05:02.093
If it wasn’t a fairly large frog, then
what was it that was fairly large, huh?

05:02.176 --> 05:04.387
Hey! What are you wiping your hands for?

05:04.470 --> 05:07.140
Well, frogs are gross, right?

05:07.223 --> 05:08.891
They secrete mucus and all.

05:08.975 --> 05:10.143
Gross…?

05:10.226 --> 05:11.519
What about mucus!

05:11.602 --> 05:13.021
Anyway,

05:13.604 --> 05:15.815
I know nothing.

05:16.441 --> 05:19.360
<i>Knowing too much is never a good thing.</i>

05:19.444 --> 05:22.363
<i>Lord Jinshi is a high-ranking official,</i>
<i>and I am merely a servant.</i>

05:22.447 --> 05:24.615
<i>Nothing more, nothing less.</i>

05:24.699 --> 05:27.577
<i>There's no need to know</i>
<i>unnecessary secrets.</i>

05:35.418 --> 05:36.919
Do you want to check?

05:46.512 --> 05:48.514
<i>I definitely went too far</i>
<i>with the provocation!</i>

05:53.144 --> 05:56.773
<i>What should I do? Should I kick him?</i>

06:12.747 --> 06:13.623
What was that?

06:23.382 --> 06:25.051
<i>Well done.</i>

06:25.134 --> 06:27.470
Hey! What’s wrong, boy?

06:27.553 --> 06:29.347
Suddenly running off like that.

06:29.430 --> 06:30.306
<i>This voice…</i>

06:32.934 --> 06:34.227
Lord Lihaku!

06:34.310 --> 06:35.895
Could you please pull us up?

06:35.978 --> 06:37.522
Huh? Young lady!

06:38.272 --> 06:40.775
What are you doing in a place like that?

06:43.736 --> 06:44.737
I see.

06:45.404 --> 06:48.116
So, you were targeted by a gun
and had to jump into the waterfall.

06:48.866 --> 06:51.285
They fired,
but I couldn’t see their faces.

06:52.703 --> 06:54.497
I’m glad you’re safe.

06:55.206 --> 06:58.459
So, why are you with this guy?

06:59.043 --> 07:00.837
It’s hard to explain.

07:00.920 --> 07:04.048
Ah, well, whatever.

07:04.715 --> 07:05.925
Can you tell me

07:06.008 --> 07:08.261
which men brought a gun for this hunt?

07:08.344 --> 07:12.056
No one. Such a thing is unsuitable
for hunting in the forest.

07:12.140 --> 07:16.018
It’s more reasonable to assume someone
secretly brought it for an assassination.

07:16.727 --> 07:18.187
Shall we inspect their belongings then?

07:18.771 --> 07:19.772
But…

07:19.856 --> 07:22.984
The guests are all high-ranking officials
invited by Lord Shishou.

07:23.776 --> 07:27.613
I doubt any of them would keep
an assassination weapon on hand.

07:29.449 --> 07:31.534
Lord Lihaku, that dog,

07:31.617 --> 07:34.996
besides responding to the whistle,
is it trained for anything else?

07:36.789 --> 07:40.501
It's able to find rabbit holes, at least.

07:40.585 --> 07:42.920
<i>It’s got a charming personality, but…</i>

07:43.004 --> 07:44.881
Ji-- I mean, Lord Kousen.

07:44.964 --> 07:46.382
What?

07:46.466 --> 07:48.551
<i>He’s angry.</i>

07:48.634 --> 07:50.428
<i>Well, of course.</i>

07:50.511 --> 07:54.015
<i>After what happened,</i>
<i>I couldn’t help but provoke him.</i>

07:54.098 --> 07:56.517
<i>But he was trying to tell me</i>
<i>something important.</i>

07:57.310 --> 07:59.145
<i>And yet, because I didn’t want to know,</i>

07:59.228 --> 08:01.272
<i>I kept on saying ridiculous things.</i>

08:01.981 --> 08:05.526
<i>He is someone with great confidence</i>
<i>in his appearance.</i>

08:06.194 --> 08:08.488
<i>Even his "frog" must be quite dignified.</i>

08:08.571 --> 08:10.198
<i>And yet, I called it "fairly."</i>

08:11.991 --> 08:13.284
<i>It’s awkward,</i>

08:13.367 --> 08:15.369
<i>but I have to say what needs to be said.</i>

08:16.412 --> 08:17.622
Perhaps,

08:17.705 --> 08:21.542
we can identify the shooter from earlier.

08:28.549 --> 08:29.550
Excuse me.

08:30.176 --> 08:31.552
What is it?

08:31.636 --> 08:32.678
This.

08:38.059 --> 08:39.519
Hey, is that…

08:41.646 --> 08:43.022
It’s my master's robe.

08:45.650 --> 08:48.486
I found it caught on the river rocks.

08:49.028 --> 08:52.073
There was no one nearby. Also,
beyond that point, the current is strong.

08:52.156 --> 08:55.243
With last night’s rain,
the water level has risen.

08:55.326 --> 08:56.953
If he was swept away…

08:57.745 --> 08:59.080
Search for him immediately!

08:59.163 --> 09:01.249
-Yes!
-Hurry!

09:01.332 --> 09:04.460
<i>Panicking now won’t change anything.</i>

09:05.419 --> 09:08.756
Then, I’ll join the search as well.

09:18.057 --> 09:20.851
<i>What are you planning, Lord Jinshi?</i>

09:29.735 --> 09:31.612
What the heck!

09:31.696 --> 09:35.366
Ah, my apologies!

09:35.449 --> 09:37.326
What a poorly trained dog.

09:38.119 --> 09:39.120
Damn!

09:39.996 --> 09:41.455
There, there.

09:52.091 --> 09:53.384
What’s wrong?

09:53.467 --> 09:54.427
Lord Basen!

09:54.510 --> 09:55.344
This…

09:58.848 --> 10:01.559
This is my master's robe. Is this blood?

10:02.184 --> 10:03.019
Was anyone around?

10:03.686 --> 10:05.438
The ground isn’t wet,

10:05.521 --> 10:07.481
so I don’t believe anyone was nearby.

10:08.149 --> 10:09.442
I see.

10:09.525 --> 10:12.528
However,
this was found along with the robe.

10:12.612 --> 10:14.530
A hawk feather?

10:14.614 --> 10:17.700
Was it made as a talisman for falconry?

10:18.826 --> 10:20.119
Possibly.

10:20.703 --> 10:21.996
I’m sorry, but…

10:22.079 --> 10:24.665
could I ask to check
everyone’s belongings?

10:27.335 --> 10:28.919
We found it!

10:31.255 --> 10:33.633
It’s the same arrowhead
as the one found at the riverbank.

10:33.716 --> 10:36.761
I don’t know anything!
This must be a mistake!

10:36.844 --> 10:39.388
Then why was your arrowhead

10:39.472 --> 10:42.308
found by the river
along with our master's robe?

10:42.391 --> 10:43.225
Loen?

10:43.893 --> 10:44.852
S… Someone…

10:44.935 --> 10:47.021
Someone must have
switched it with my arrowhead!

10:47.104 --> 10:48.773
To frame me!

10:48.856 --> 10:51.734
<i>What does he mean? Could it be…?</i>

10:52.401 --> 10:54.987
<i>Loen’s reaction seems genuine.</i>

10:55.071 --> 10:57.990
<i>And his men don’t seem suspicious either.</i>

10:58.783 --> 11:01.786
Then, why not check if there are

11:01.869 --> 11:03.621
any other arrowheads?

11:04.288 --> 11:05.289
Not just the riverbank,

11:05.998 --> 11:08.167
but a thorough search
of the forest as well.

11:10.461 --> 11:11.712
Understood.

11:11.796 --> 11:14.298
Conduct a thorough search of the forest!

11:14.382 --> 11:15.341
Yes, sir!

11:24.183 --> 11:27.061
<i>Let’s hope they take the bait.</i>

11:34.193 --> 11:35.945
Damn it! What the hell is going on!

11:36.028 --> 11:37.863
I don’t know anything about an arrowhead!

11:40.241 --> 11:42.451
Did you find something?

11:45.538 --> 11:46.455
Is that…?

11:51.544 --> 11:52.628
Give it back!

11:57.842 --> 11:59.218
You… You’re the guy from earlier!

12:02.096 --> 12:04.765
It seems dogs don’t like you very much.

12:16.986 --> 12:21.198
With this scent, any dog
with a keen nose would react immediately.

12:23.451 --> 12:25.911
So that’s why you didn’t bring

12:26.454 --> 12:27.955
the dog along on your hunt.

12:29.999 --> 12:31.750
The contents have
already been confiscated.

12:32.251 --> 12:34.086
There were three guns inside.

12:35.087 --> 12:36.547
It's foreign-made.

12:36.630 --> 12:39.175
Most likely
the latest model from the West.

12:40.801 --> 12:42.470
I can still smell the gunpowder.

12:42.553 --> 12:44.930
They’re quite small.

12:45.014 --> 12:47.224
I’ve never seen this type before either.

12:51.353 --> 12:54.815
I see, it sparks using a metal component.

12:54.899 --> 12:59.528
When gunpowder - made from charcoal,
saltpeter, and sulfur - explodes,

12:59.612 --> 13:03.616
it gives off a stench so strong
that you'd want to pinch your nose.

13:03.699 --> 13:06.035
A smell like a rotten eggs.

13:07.286 --> 13:08.579
Yes,

13:08.662 --> 13:11.457
<i>it’s the same smell I smelled</i>
<i>when we were shot on the cliff.</i>

13:11.999 --> 13:14.418
When we let the dog sniff the gunpowder,

13:14.502 --> 13:17.630
it immediately tracked down this gun.

13:17.713 --> 13:22.384
And of course, it also picked up the scent
of gunpowder on the shooter as well.

13:22.468 --> 13:23.886
What a smart dog.

13:25.054 --> 13:27.515
Good boy.

13:28.140 --> 13:30.100
<i>Even though it was a setup,</i>

13:30.184 --> 13:33.020
<i>I feel bad for the old guys</i>
<i>who were used as bait.</i>

13:34.980 --> 13:36.357
Lord Kousen!

13:37.066 --> 13:37.983
Basen.

13:38.067 --> 13:39.985
What was that gunshot just now?
Are you hurt?

13:40.069 --> 13:43.030
One moment you disappear,

13:43.113 --> 13:44.907
and then, I'm shown a torn piece of cloth,

13:44.990 --> 13:47.117
and then I'm told, "Take me to this man."

13:47.201 --> 13:49.245
I have no idea what is going on!

13:49.328 --> 13:51.830
Sorry. What’s the situation?

13:55.668 --> 13:57.461
The people related to this man

13:57.545 --> 14:00.548
are being watched so
they can be captured at any time.

14:00.631 --> 14:04.134
So, all that’s left is
to confirm the charges.

14:04.218 --> 14:05.177
Understood.

14:20.025 --> 14:23.737
<i>After that, the masked guest</i>
<i>returned to the mountain lodge,</i>

14:24.321 --> 14:26.615
<i>and the banquet ended.</i>

14:36.292 --> 14:38.043
<i>The midday disappearance incident</i>

14:38.752 --> 14:42.965
<i>was officially handled as a whim</i>
<i>of the masked person.</i>

14:43.924 --> 14:44.925
<i>It’s a well-known fact that</i>

14:45.551 --> 14:48.929
<i>at the banquet,</i>
<i>a certain group disappeared.</i>

14:49.889 --> 14:51.599
<i>From now on, those people</i>

14:51.682 --> 14:53.767
<i>will never appear</i>
<i>on the public stage again.</i>

14:55.936 --> 14:59.023
<i>He looked tired,</i>
<i>as if something had happened.</i>

14:59.899 --> 15:03.235
<i>But as someone standing here</i>
<i>in place of Lord Jinshi,</i>

15:03.903 --> 15:06.322
<i>it is not my place</i>
<i>to be concerned about that.</i>

15:10.618 --> 15:12.036
<i>I still have a long way to go.</i>

15:12.745 --> 15:16.081
Was it too dull a spectacle for a eunuch?

15:16.165 --> 15:19.335
No, I have been enjoying myself.

15:19.919 --> 15:22.463
It must be difficult,

15:22.546 --> 15:26.383
having just drawn the Empress's wrath
and then being forced to become a eunuch.

15:26.467 --> 15:28.218
That’s all in the past now.

15:28.802 --> 15:31.805
Besides, the sake for moon viewing
is quite fine.

15:32.806 --> 15:35.768
<i>I became a eunuch, cast away my name,</i>

15:35.851 --> 15:38.062
<i>and took on the name Gaoshun.</i>

15:38.646 --> 15:40.814
<i>Yet, during the banquet,</i>

15:40.898 --> 15:43.525
<i>I was still treated as</i>
<i>a member of the Maa household.</i>

15:44.068 --> 15:46.278
<i>That’s how things are.</i>

15:47.071 --> 15:50.324
Still, it’s a pity that
the beautiful eunuch

15:50.407 --> 15:53.786
did not participate in this hunt.

15:54.620 --> 15:57.706
Well, we have the masked one
in attendance this time.

15:57.790 --> 16:01.377
If such a beautiful face were to join,

16:01.460 --> 16:05.089
it would overshadow everything else.

16:06.048 --> 16:07.424
They say the masked one

16:07.508 --> 16:11.595
bears severe burn scars
upon his noble face.

16:11.679 --> 16:15.224
I hear that even tonight,
he remains locked away in his room.

16:15.307 --> 16:17.351
The Emperor must be worried.

16:17.434 --> 16:20.062
To think that "he" is the Crown Prince.

16:20.854 --> 16:21.855
Yes…

16:22.356 --> 16:23.565
<i>"He," huh?</i>

16:24.108 --> 16:26.485
<i>There is no sign of reverence</i>
<i>toward the Crown Prince.</i>

16:27.820 --> 16:29.530
So, what of it?

16:30.114 --> 16:32.825
Since the death of the previous Prince,

16:32.908 --> 16:34.994
has any consort conceived a child?

16:35.661 --> 16:37.913
I’m afraid I don’t know.

16:39.289 --> 16:42.001
Apologies, I may have had
a bit too much to drink.

16:47.006 --> 16:49.258
<i>Everyone is watching, trying to determine</i>

16:50.342 --> 16:52.302
<i>whether the guest of honor for this hunt…</i>

16:52.386 --> 16:55.347
<i>that is, His Majesty’s younger brother</i>

16:55.973 --> 16:59.768
<i>is truly fit to inherit the throne.</i>

17:03.355 --> 17:04.982
<i>I wonder…</i>

17:05.065 --> 17:08.110
<i>Has Lord Jinshi told Xiaomao the truth?</i>

17:10.154 --> 17:13.073
<i>She must be informed</i>

17:13.157 --> 17:15.534
<i>in order to prepare</i>
<i>for the challenges ahead.</i>

17:15.617 --> 17:16.827
<i>She is, after all,</i>

17:16.910 --> 17:18.912
<i>a highly valuable asset.</i>

17:20.956 --> 17:22.124
<i>It may sound cruel,</i>

17:23.333 --> 17:25.794
<i>but the more usable pieces</i>
<i>we have, the better.</i>

17:28.881 --> 17:32.634
<i>Yet again, this affair</i>
<i>has left an unpleasant aftertaste.</i>

17:33.552 --> 17:35.137
<i>Just like back then…</i>

17:35.929 --> 17:38.974
<i>There’s still a lot we don’t know about</i>

17:39.058 --> 17:41.226
<i>the source of the gun</i>
<i>and their true intentions.</i>

17:42.311 --> 17:43.812
It's foreign-made.

17:43.896 --> 17:46.231
Most likely
the latest model from the West.

17:47.149 --> 17:48.525
The West, huh?

17:49.568 --> 17:52.863
<i>Identical envoys, like two mirror images.</i>

17:53.489 --> 17:57.493
<i>The story that one daughter managed to</i>
<i>slip out of her room while being watched.</i>

17:57.576 --> 18:00.037
<i>Most likely,</i>
<i>that story is about the twin envoys.</i>

18:00.871 --> 18:02.414
<i>What exactly was she doing</i>

18:02.498 --> 18:04.583
<i>sneaking out of her room?</i>

18:05.167 --> 18:08.462
<i>Was she plotting some treachery,</i>

18:08.545 --> 18:10.881
<i>like the younger sister</i>
<i>who became pregnant?</i>

18:10.964 --> 18:12.216
<i>Or perhaps…</i>

18:15.135 --> 18:18.388
<i>I can only hope the men we captured today</i>
<i>can give us some answers.</i>

18:19.681 --> 18:20.808
Got a moment?

18:22.059 --> 18:23.352
<i>Why is he here?!</i>

18:23.435 --> 18:25.938
<i>Wasn't he at the banquet?</i>

18:32.694 --> 18:33.862
No need to open the door.

18:34.446 --> 18:36.698
I must have startled you quite a bit.

18:36.782 --> 18:37.908
Sorry about that.

18:41.662 --> 18:43.539
<i>I don’t even have to see your face</i>

18:43.622 --> 18:45.332
<i>to know what expression you’re making.</i>

18:45.999 --> 18:47.543
I don’t mind.

18:48.210 --> 18:50.587
If anything,
I should be the one apologizing.

18:51.505 --> 18:53.882
<i>For saying it was "fairly" large.</i>

18:55.300 --> 18:58.637
<i>I wonder what Lord Jinshi is thinking?</i>

18:59.346 --> 19:01.181
<i>I’ve never been good</i>

19:01.265 --> 19:03.517
<i>at reading people’s emotions.</i>

19:04.434 --> 19:08.689
<i>The women who raised me were courtesans,</i>
<i>devoted to their work above all else.</i>

19:09.273 --> 19:13.110
<i>No matter how much I cried,</i>
<i>I was ignored until their work was done.</i>

19:15.654 --> 19:17.114
<i>In time, I came to understand,</i>

19:17.698 --> 19:19.867
<i>and eventually,</i>
<i>I became a baby who didn’t cry.</i>

19:21.326 --> 19:22.744
<i>Maybe that’s why</i>

19:22.828 --> 19:25.622
<i>I struggle to recognize</i>
<i>both kindness and malice in people.</i>

19:26.707 --> 19:28.167
<i>Even now,</i>

19:28.250 --> 19:30.460
<i>I don’t know what I’m supposed</i>
<i>to say in times like these.</i>

19:32.045 --> 19:34.047
I won't say anything.

19:37.676 --> 19:39.261
To me,

19:40.012 --> 19:42.264
Lord Jinshi is Lord Jinshi.

19:45.851 --> 19:47.853
<i>That’s how I truly feel.</i>

19:48.437 --> 19:51.231
<i>Whether you have balls or not,</i>

19:51.315 --> 19:53.609
<i>it’s not like</i>
<i>I’d be looking at them anyway.</i>

19:53.692 --> 19:55.652
<i>So it doesn’t matter to me.</i>

19:57.279 --> 19:59.406
To you, am I still me?

20:04.912 --> 20:06.163
No need to be so wary.

20:06.997 --> 20:08.540
I just wanted to give you this.

20:17.799 --> 20:19.676
Along with giving you that,

20:19.760 --> 20:21.595
there’s something I’ve been
meaning to tell you.

20:23.472 --> 20:25.641
It might cause you some trouble, but…

20:25.724 --> 20:26.808
<i>This is…</i>

20:27.601 --> 20:29.728
The reason I brought you
on this journey was…

20:29.811 --> 20:31.271
<i>O…o…o…</i>

20:31.355 --> 20:32.856
That is why!

20:32.940 --> 20:35.067
<i>Ox bezoar!</i>

20:35.150 --> 20:37.319
<i>A highly valuable ox bezoar!</i>

20:37.402 --> 20:39.738
<i>The legendary elixir</i>
<i>I’ve dreamed of is now</i>

20:39.821 --> 20:41.740
<i>in my hands!</i>

20:42.407 --> 20:44.868
Ah. Sorry for keeping you waiting.

20:44.952 --> 20:46.328
I finally got to--

20:46.411 --> 20:48.288
No, that’s not it!

20:48.372 --> 20:49.915
Thank you very much!

20:58.799 --> 20:59.758
Well then, good night!

21:04.221 --> 21:05.973
Hey! Don’t just slip away on your own!

21:06.056 --> 21:08.141
I’m not finished talking yet!

21:10.811 --> 21:13.981
<i>I don’t want anyone to interfere!</i>

21:14.481 --> 21:15.315
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

21:19.111 --> 21:22.197
<i>Whether Lord Jinshi is a eunuch</i>
<i>or not doesn’t matter to me.</i>

21:22.281 --> 21:24.950
<i>But I do owe him for the ox bezoar.</i>

21:25.784 --> 21:29.162
<i>If his secret is ever exposed</i>
<i>and he finds himself in danger,</i>

21:29.246 --> 21:30.455
<i>at that time…</i>

21:31.999 --> 21:34.710
<i>I’ll make sure to turn</i>
<i>him into a real eunuch.</i>

21:36.295 --> 21:39.256
Hey, are you even listening!

21:39.339 --> 21:42.592
Hey! Listen until the end
when someone’s talking!

21:43.593 --> 21:44.845
<i>In this country,</i>

21:44.928 --> 21:47.014
<i>some bear the character</i>
<i>"Flower" in their name.</i>

21:47.097 --> 21:49.349
<i>-There are currently only two of them.</i>
-Apothecary!

21:51.393 --> 21:54.271
<i>The Emperor, who stands</i>
<i>at the pinnacle of the nation.</i>

21:54.354 --> 21:55.439
<i>And…</i>

21:56.148 --> 21:57.899
<i>Lord Jinshi…</i>

21:58.483 --> 22:00.819
<i>No, the Moon Prince.</i>

22:02.863 --> 22:05.782
<i>You cannot remain</i>
<i>in a temporary position forever.</i>

22:08.118 --> 22:11.204
<i>You are the Emperor’s younger brother,</i>

22:13.206 --> 22:14.958
<i>Ka Zuigetsu.</i>

23:46.007 --> 23:50.345
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:57.435 --> 24:00.147
<i>The next episode is "The Bathhouse."</i>

24:00.230 --> 24:01.898
